      "title": "Search term interpolated into SQL",
      "description": "The index action puts params[:q] straight into the WHERE string. Nothing escapes or binds the value. Any authenticated caller can inject SQL and read or change any table, including api_token values. Pass the search term as a bound parameter and escape LIKE wildcards with sanitize_sql_like.",
